{"id":"vod_md_48391","vodId":"48391","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"全修。","name_cn":"全修。","date":"2025-01-01","year":"2025","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20250108-1/e66c9a99f23ffd417d68ab14baaa1930.jpg"},"summary":"广濑夏子高中毕业后成为了一名原画师，迅速展现出自己的才华，并很快以导演身份出道。首次导演的作品成了社会现象般的大作，广受好评。夏子被评价为新锐天才导演，并决定下一部作品是以初恋为主题的剧场恋爱喜剧。然而，从未体验过恋爱的夏子对初恋毫无概念，因而无法创作分镜，电影制作也陷入僵局。某天在绘制分镜时，夏子突然失去了意识，当她醒来时，发现自己已经身处于小时候沉迷的动画电影《灭亡物语》的世界之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-03-24 19:38:01","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20250108/NF1Fpjmu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20250113/57aM2IYh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20250120/4P1puAef/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20250130/Tpz3zKs6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20250205/DtlyGDOM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20250212/nfiSBxZk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20250219/tsMN30O3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20250225/UWV15d5i/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20250306/nNLHwBio/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20250313/JBHe7Xdi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20250318/BHVseLRB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx11.com/20250324/xGa74siY/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:23.129Z"}